{"type":"tool_end","payload":{"toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-a847f3bbcbcbb8bb","result":"<file path=\"/Users/andres.mesa/_dev/GLB/stepwise-fifa-qa/artifacts/inputs/documentation/prd.md\" lines=\"145\" start=\"1\" end=\"100\" returned=\"100\" has_more=\"true\" truncated=\"false\">\n     1|# InsideFIFA-WEB Product Requirements Document\n     2|\n     3|## Project Overview\n     4|**Project Name:** InsideFIFA-WEB  \n     5|**Description:** Web automation test project to validate navigation and functionality of https://inside.fifa.com/  \n     6|**Version:** 1.0.0  \n     7|**Date:** 2026-08-21  \n     8|\n     9|## Functional Requirements (FR)\n    10|\n    11|### FR-001: Homepage Navigation Validation\n    12|**Priority:** Must Have  \n    13|**Description:** Validate that the homepage loads correctly and all primary navigation elements are functional  \n    14|**Acceptance Criteria:** \n    15|- Homepage loads within 3 seconds\n    16|- All visible links are clickable\n    17|- No broken images or missing content\n    18|- Page is responsive on desktop viewport\n    19|\n    20|### FR-002: \"What FIFA Does\" Subpages Navigation\n    21|**Priority:** Must Have  \n    22|**Description:** Validate navigation to all \"What FIFA does\" subpages from https://inside.fifa.com/all-topics  \n    23|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    24|- Legal page loads and displays content\n    25|- Transfer system page loads and displays content  \n    26|- Women's Football page loads and displays content\n    27|- Advancing football page loads and displays content\n    28|- Refereeing page loads and displays content\n    29|- Innovation page loads and displays content\n    30|- Talent development page loads and displays content\n    31|\n    32|### FR-003: Top Navigation \"Inside FIFA\" Validation\n    33|**Priority:** Must Have  \n    34|**Description:** Validate the \"Inside FIFA\" button in top navigation and all its sub-items  \n    35|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    36|- \"Inside FIFA\" button is visible and clickable\n    37|- All sub-items under \"Inside FIFA\" are accessible\n    38|- Navigation through sub-items works correctly\n    39|- Each sub-item page loads successfully\n    40|\n    41|### FR-004: Multi-language Support Readiness\n    42|**Priority:** Should Have  \n    43|**Description:** Ensure framework is ready to test English, Spanish, and French versions  \n    44|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    45|- English version (en) is fully tested\n    46|- Framework supports Spanish (es) and French (fr) language switching\n    47|- Language-specific content validation is possible\n    48|\n    49|### FR-005: Cross-browser Expansion Readiness  \n    50|**Priority:** Could Have  \n    51|**Description:** Framework should be extensible for other browsers beyond Chrome  \n    52|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    53|- Current implementation works on Chrome\n    54|- Architecture supports adding Firefox, Safari, Edge\n    55|- Browser-specific configurations are externalized\n    56|\n    57|## Non-Functional Requirements (NFR)\n    58|\n    59|### NFR-001: Performance\n    60|**Target:** Page load times under 3 seconds  \n    61|**Category:** Performance  \n    62|**Measurement:** Average load time across 5 test runs  \n    63|\n    64|### NFR-002: Reliability  \n    65|**Target:** 95% test pass rate in stable environment  \n    66|**Category:** Reliability  \n    67|**Measurement:** Pass/fail ratio over 100 test executions  \n    68|\n    69|### NFR-003: Maintainability  \n    70|**Target:** Test suite updates within 2 hours for UI changes  \n    71|**Category:** Maintainability  \n    72|**Measurement:** Time to update tests after UI changes  \n    73|\n    74|### NFR-004: Cross-platform Compatibility  \n    75|**Target:** Support desktop viewport (1920x1080) initially  \n    76|**Category:** Compatibility  \n    77|**Measurement:** Successful execution on desktop Chrome  \n    78|\n    79|## Risks (RSK)\n    80|\n    81|### RSK-001: Website Structure Changes\n    82|**Description:** FIFA may change website structure breaking navigation tests  \n    83|**Impact:** High  \n    84|**Mitigation:** Implement robust selectors and regular test maintenance  \n    85|\n    86|### RSK-002: Rate Limiting/Blocking\n    87|**Description:** Automated access may trigger rate limiting or IP blocking  \n    88|**Impact:** Medium  \n    89|**Mitigation:** Implement test delays and consider rotating IP addresses  \n    90|\n    91|### RSK-003: Content Localization Variations\n    92|**Description:** Different language versions may have different page structures  \n    93|**Impact:** Medium  \n    94|**Mitigation:** Create language-specific test configurations  \n    95|\n    96|### RSK-004: Browser Compatibility Issues\n    97|**Description:** Tests may fail on different browser versions  \n    98|**Impact:** Low (initially)  \n    99|**Mitigation:** Version-specific test configurations and regular updates  \n   100|\n</file>","isError":false}}
